#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:1
msgid "Glossary"
msgstr "术语表"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:3
msgid ""
"**AOI (area of interest).** The geographic region you care about, usually a "
"bounding box `(min_lon, min_lat, max_lon, max_lat)` in EPSG:4326."
msgstr ""
"**AOI（感兴趣区域）。** 您关注的地理区域，通常是 EPSG:4326 下的边界框 `(min_lon, min_lat, max_lon, "
"max_lat)`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:6
msgid ""
"**Asset.** One file belonging to a scene, such as a band, a thumbnail, "
"metadata or an archive. Modelled by `SatelliteAsset`."
msgstr "**资产（Asset）。** 属于某个场景的一个文件，例如波段、缩略图、元数据或归档文件。由 `SatelliteAsset` 建模。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:9
msgid ""
"**Baseline (processing baseline).** The version of the Sentinel-2 processing"
" chain. From 04.00, L2A reflectance carries a +1000 digital-number offset."
msgstr ""
"**基线（处理基线）。** Sentinel-2 处理链的版本。从 04.00 起，L2A 反射率带有 +1000 的数字量化值（DN）偏移。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:12
msgid ""
"**Burst.** One of the sub-swaths-in-time of a Sentinel-1 TOPS acquisition. "
"Burst-level synchronisation matters for InSAR stacks."
msgstr "**突发（Burst）。** Sentinel-1 TOPS 采集中按时间划分的子条带之一。突发级同步对 InSAR 堆栈很重要。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:15
msgid ""
"**Circuit breaker.** A guard that stops calling a provider after repeated "
"failures and retries after a recovery timeout. See [Error handling](error-"
"handling.md#circuit-breaker)."
msgstr ""
"**熔断器（Circuit breaker）。** 一种保护机制，在多次失败后停止调用某个提供商，并在恢复超时后重试。参见[错误处理](error-"
"handling.md#circuit-breaker)。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:18
msgid ""
"**COG (Cloud-Optimized GeoTIFF).** A GeoTIFF with internal tiling and "
"overviews, so a client can read part of it with HTTP range requests. See "
"[Streaming](../data-access/streaming.md)."
msgstr ""
"**COG（云优化 GeoTIFF）。** 具有内部分块和概览的 GeoTIFF，客户端可以通过 HTTP "
"范围请求读取其中一部分。参见[流式读取](../data-access/streaming.md)。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:21
msgid ""
"**Coherence.** A 0 to 1 measure of phase similarity between two SAR "
"acquisitions. Low coherence means the surface changed or decorrelated."
msgstr ""
"**相干性（Coherence）。** 衡量两次 SAR 采集之间相位相似程度的 0 到 1 的指标。相干性低意味着地表发生了变化或失相干。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:24
msgid ""
"**Cosine correction.** A simple topographic illumination correction that "
"divides reflectance by the cosine of the solar incidence angle."
msgstr "**余弦校正。** 一种简单的地形光照校正方法，将反射率除以太阳入射角的余弦值。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:27
msgid ""
"**CFAR.** Constant false alarm rate, a thresholding method for detecting "
"bright targets in SAR imagery."
msgstr "**CFAR。** 恒虚警率，一种用于检测 SAR 影像中亮目标的阈值方法。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:30
msgid "**DEM.** Digital elevation model."
msgstr "**DEM。** 数字高程模型。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:32
msgid ""
"**DoD (DEM of Difference).** The subtraction of two DEMs, used to measure "
"volume change."
msgstr "**DoD（差分 DEM）。** 两个 DEM 相减，用于测量体积变化。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:34
msgid ""
"**DN (digital number).** The raw integer pixel value before scaling to "
"reflectance."
msgstr "**DN（数字量化值）。** 缩放为反射率之前的原始整数像元值。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:36
msgid ""
"**GRD.** Ground Range Detected: Sentinel-1 amplitude imagery without phase."
msgstr "**GRD。** 地距检测（Ground Range Detected）：不含相位的 Sentinel-1 幅度影像。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:38
msgid ""
"**InSAR.** Interferometric SAR: using the phase difference between two "
"acquisitions to measure surface deformation."
msgstr "**InSAR。** 干涉 SAR：利用两次采集之间的相位差来测量地表形变。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:41
msgid "**Interferogram.** The phase difference image formed from two SLCs."
msgstr "**干涉图（Interferogram）。** 由两幅 SLC 形成的相位差影像。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:43
msgid ""
"**L1C / L2A.** Sentinel-2 top-of-atmosphere (L1C) and surface reflectance "
"(L2A) products."
msgstr "**L1C / L2A。** Sentinel-2 的大气层顶（L1C）和地表反射率（L2A）产品。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:45
msgid ""
"**Landsat Collection 2.** USGS's reprocessed Landsat archive, delivered at "
"Level-1 and Level-2."
msgstr ""
"**Landsat Collection 2。** USGS 重新处理的 Landsat 存档，以 Level-1 和 Level-2 提供。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:47
msgid ""
"**NDVI.** Normalized Difference Vegetation Index, `(NIR - Red) / (NIR + "
"Red)`."
msgstr "**NDVI。** 归一化植被指数，`(NIR - Red) / (NIR + Red)`。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:49
msgid ""
"**Offset tracking.** Measuring displacement by cross-correlating image "
"patches. Works on optical and SAR amplitude imagery."
msgstr "**偏移追踪（Offset tracking）。** 通过对影像块做互相关来测量位移。适用于光学和 SAR 幅度影像。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:52
msgid ""
"**Post-processing action.** A step run after a download, such as `unzip`, "
"clip, reproject or COG conversion."
msgstr "**后处理操作。** 下载之后运行的一个步骤，例如 `unzip`、裁剪、重投影或 COG 转换。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:55
msgid ""
"**Provider.** An adapter for one data source. See [Providers](../data-"
"access/providers.md)."
msgstr "**提供商（Provider）。** 针对某一数据源的适配器。参见[提供商](../data-access/providers.md)。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:57
msgid ""
"**SAFE.** The Sentinel product directory format, usually delivered as "
"`.SAFE.zip`."
msgstr "**SAFE。** Sentinel 产品目录格式，通常以 `.SAFE.zip` 形式交付。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:59
msgid ""
"**SAR.** Synthetic aperture radar, an active microwave sensor that images "
"day and night through cloud."
msgstr "**SAR。** 合成孔径雷达，一种主动式微波传感器，可昼夜穿透云层成像。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:62
msgid ""
"**SBAS.** Small BAseline Subset: a time-series InSAR method that combines "
"many short-baseline interferograms."
msgstr "**SBAS。** 小基线集（Small BAseline Subset）：一种组合多个短基线干涉图的时间序列 InSAR 方法。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:65
msgid ""
"**SLC.** Single Look Complex: SAR imagery that preserves phase, needed for "
"InSAR."
msgstr "**SLC。** 单视复数（Single Look Complex）：保留相位的 SAR 影像，InSAR 需要使用。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:67
msgid ""
"**STAC.** SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog: a standard JSON format for "
"describing geospatial assets, used by many providers."
msgstr ""
"**STAC。** 时空资产目录（SpatioTemporal Asset Catalog）：用于描述地理空间资产的标准 JSON "
"格式，被许多提供商使用。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:70
msgid ""
"**Streaming.** Reading only the pixels you need from a remote file instead "
"of downloading all of it."
msgstr "**流式读取（Streaming）。** 仅从远程文件中读取所需的像元，而不是下载整个文件。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:73
msgid ""
"**TOPS.** Terrain Observation by Progressive Scans, the Sentinel-1 wide-"
"swath acquisition mode."
msgstr ""
"**TOPS。** 渐进扫描地形观测（Terrain Observation by Progressive Scans），Sentinel-1 "
"的宽幅采集模式。"

#: ../../home/claude/work/docs_audit/docs_out/reference/glossary.md:75
msgid ""
"**Unwrapping.** Converting wrapped interferometric phase (modulo 2 pi) to "
"continuous phase; pygeofetch uses `snaphu`."
msgstr "**解缠（Unwrapping）。** 将缠绕的干涉相位（模 2 pi）转换为连续相位；pygeofetch 使用 `snaphu`。"
